  "analysis": "\n\n• **Atelier Bois & Co (d5, d6) | €6,250 | 2 docs**\n  - *Ambiguity:* d5 (“Chantier : 4 rue du Port”) vs d6 (“Meuble de rangement salle de stérilisation”) lack explicit entity assignment.\n  - *Q:* Which entity owns these carpenter works?\n  - *Answers/Rules:* (1) d5→LMNP, d6→SELARL → *depends on site address*; (2) Both SELARL → *always SELARL*; (3) Both LMNP → *always LMNP*.\n\n• **Prévia Assurances (d1, d2, d3) | €1,704 | 3 docs**\n  - *Ambiguity:* d1 (“Cotisation annuelle : 520,00 €”) & d3 (“Souscripteur : SELARL Cabinet Dentaire Morel”) are SELARL-paid but name Hélène; d2 (“Assuré : M. Paul Morel”) names Paul.\n  - *Q:* Are these Prévia contracts personal or SELARL business expenses?\n  - *Answers/Rules:* (1) All personal → *always personal*; (2) d1/d3→SELARL, d2→personal → *depends on insured person*; (3) All SELARL → *always SELARL*.\n\n• **Paul/LMNP boundary (d4, d7) | ~€40 | 2 docs**\n  - *Ambiguity:* d4 (“LOYER 4 RUE DU PORT MAI 650,00”) & d7 (“ligne installée au 4 rue du Port”) link Paul’s personal account/bill to LMNP rent/usage.\n  - *Q:* Should Paul’s joint account and Fibre line be treated as personal or LMNP expenses?\n  - *Answers/Rules:* (1) Personal → *always personal*; (2) LMNP → *always LMNP*; (3) Mixed → *ask each time*.",
